                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma^+
          %p
            Its realization as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dg-operad"} dg-operad
            is discussed in detail in
          %ul#BerFre01
            %li
              C. Berger,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Combinatorial models for real configuration spaces and
                  = succeed "-operads" do
